· MEGA profile", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 3210}, "screen4": {"x": 0, "y": 3532, "text": "Screen 4 · Family", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 3210}, "screen5": {"x": 0, "y": 4796, "text": "Screen 5 · Onboarding and first launch", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 4620}, "screen6": {"x": 0, "y": 6060, "text": "Screen 6 · Push notification → app", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 3210}, "screen7": {"x": 0, "y": 7324, "text": "Screen 7 · Settings (theme, wallpaper)", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 3210}, "screen8": {"x": 0, "y": 8588, "text": "Screen 8 · Widgets", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 3210}, "screen9": {"x": 0, "y": 9852, "text": "Screen 9 · Sign in and joining", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 6030}, "screen10": {"x": 0, "y": 11116, "text": "Screen 10 · Kids: homework, routines, Mega Bucks", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 6030}, "screen10defaults": {"x": 6110, "y": 11376, "w": 420, "text": "Defaults to confirm\n• Homework: a parent photographs the sheet in their own chat; MEGA (Muse Spark, image input) writes 3–5 new questions at the kid's level.\n• Kids get hints (a guiding question), never the answer.\n• Parents get a summary card and choose how many Mega Bucks to release (practice 5, chore 3 by default). Only Admin and Partner can release.\n• Bedtime prep reads tomorrow's household events; the morning routine is 4 steps set by a parent.\n• The chore push uses the Screen 6 kid push (54pt buttons, quiet hours).", "fill": "orange", "size": "s"}, "screen11": {"x": 0, "y": 12380, "text": "Screen 11 · The Store", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 4150}, "screen11defaults": {"x": 4230, "y": 12640, "w": 420, "text": "Defaults to confirm\n• Reached from the kid's own room (Store button with the balance).\n• Free from the start: bed, desk, lamp, rug, and the 6 shell colors on offer today. Store-only: other furniture (4–8), stickers (5), new colors (10), antennas (12), eye colors (10), anime eyes (15). Prices are config.\n• Eyes (owner, Oct 27): eye colors (Pink, Gold, Mint, Lilac, Ember) recolor the standard eyes in every face (open, happy, wink, closed). One pair of anime eyes was made with Muse Image and downscaled to the visor; it swaps only the resting eyes.\n• Colors, antennas and eyes are tried on live on the kid's own MEGA before buying (real sprite engine).\n• Bought furniture lands in the Decorate tray marked NEW.\n• Posters stay free and out of the Store (made with Muse Image) — confirmed by the owner, Oct 27.\n• Adults don't have a Store (their MEGA looks stay free).", "fill": "orange", "size": "s"}, "screen12": {"x": 0, "y": 13644, "text": "Screen 12 · Calendar and gift ideas", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 3210}, "screen12defaults": {"x": 3290, "y": 13904, "w": 420, "text": "Defaults to confirm\n• Two layers: Household (everyone) and Only you (private, dashed, lock). Partner's view never shows Admin's Dentist.\n• MEGA may suggest sharing; only the owner's tap shares.\n• Hub checks household events only. The Dentist overlapping soccer practice is never flagged (the negative control).\n• A clash gets one fix, labelled as from Hub (AI), with before/after. Admin approves clash fixes (owner, Oct 27); nothing changes until then.\n• Gift ideas use only shared info; products come from web search (G4).", "fill": "orange", "size": "s"}, "screen9defaults": {"x": 6110, "y": 10112, "w": 420, "fill": "orange", "size": "s", "text": "Owner feedback, Oct 28 (all applied here)\n• No empty band above MEGA: Hub stands in a spotlight and the brand block is centered above the buttons, which sit in the thumb zone (Reddit, Brink and Once on Mobbin).\n• The sheet offers Apple and Google first, then email + password with Show and Forgot password (Polarsteps, Fiverr, Cal AI). Make my MEGA opens it on Create account.\n• Loading is never blank: your MEGA paces back and forth on “Opening chats”, centered.\n• Invite: the paste field and Continue sit right under the instructions, with an example link under the field (Discord). Until the G8 camera build, the QR card is a “No link yet?” help card.\n• Adults and kids get different invite screens, chosen from the invite. Admin makes each person’s MEGA when inviting; adults keep or change it (Flighty-style personal invite), kids can’t change it at join and a grown-up types the parent code."}}, "designSystems": []}